==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{rfc-sense}} {{grammar}} Noun [[case]] used to indicate a [[temporary]] state of [[being]]. In English, this is often expressed by the adverb "as," as in "as a child, I played hopscotch." It is also used to signal the site of an action or the time at which it took place. Languages that use the essive case include [[Estonian]], [[Finnish]], [[Inuktitut]], and [[Sami]].

